cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and credit Eurostat, DESNZ and the ECB as the original publishers."
title: "Electricity-to-gas price ratio for Europe and Great Britain"
abstract: >-
  Household electricity and gas prices for 41 European countries from 2007 to 2026,
  built from Eurostat, DESNZ and ECB data, with the electricity-to-gas price ratio that
  decides whether a heat pump is cheaper to run than a gas boiler. Provenance-tracked,
  validated by eleven quality rules and refreshed weekly.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Odimayo
    given-names: Oluwagbade
repository-code: "https://github.com/gbadedata/electricity-gas-price-ratio"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
keywords:
  - energy data
  - electricity prices
  - gas prices
  - electrification
  - heat pumps
  - Eurostat
  - open data
